{"id":"stmt:kirikae1997@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0010-01","source":"source:kirikae1997","asset":"asset:kirikae1997@gemini-3-flash-preview","locator":{"leaf":10,"printed":10,"section":null,"example":null},"anchor":{"exact":"バチェラーの表記法には、アイヌ語の ci [tʃi] を chi で表し、口蓋化した s を sh で表すなど日本語のヘボン式ローマ字表記とよく似たところがある。","match":1,"method":"exact","leaf":10},"statement":{"en":"In Batchelor's romanization system, Ainu ci [tʃi] is written as chi, and palatalized s is written as sh.","ja":"バチェラーのローマ字表記法では、アイヌ語の ci [tʃi] を chi で表し、口蓋化した s を sh で表す。"},"type":"other","stance":"asserts","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"hedge":null,"reported":null,"forms":["ci","chi","sh"],"topics":["topic:sources/historical-orthographies-and-the-batchelor-tradition","topic:sources/latin-phonemic-transcription","topic:phon/s-palatalization","topic:sources/historical-orthographies-and-the-batchelor-tradition--segments"],"extracted_by":"act:extract/kirikae1997/2026-09-10T14-20-10-766Z","verification":{"anchor":"pass","image":"not-applicable","entailment":{"verdict":"yes","quote":"バチェラーの表記法には、アイヌ語の ci [tʃi] を chi で表し、口蓋化した s を sh で表すなど日本語のヘボン式ローマ字表記とよく似たところがある。","note":null,"model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","prompt_version":"verify-v1.0","date":"2026-09-10"},"human":null},"status":"checked","routing":{"section":"topic:sources/historical-orthographies-and-the-batchelor-tradition--segments","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","prompt_version":"route-v1.0","date":"2026-09-10"}}
{"id":"stmt:kirikae1997@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0011-01","source":"source:kirikae1997","asset":"asset:kirikae1997@gemini-3-flash-preview","locator":{"leaf":11,"printed":11,"section":null,"example":null},"anchor":{"exact":"「二つで一組をなすもののうちの片方」を意味する ʔarke に対して arage と arake の両形を辞書の見出しに立てている。","match":1,"method":"exact","leaf":11},"statement":{"en":"The word ʔarke means one of a pair of items.","ja":"ʔarke は「二つで一組をなすもののうちの片方」を意味する。"},"type":"form-function","stance":"asserts","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"hedge":null,"reported":null,"forms":["ʔarke","arke"],"topics":["topic:contact/lexical-semantic-fields-synopsis"],"extracted_by":"act:extract/kirikae1997/2026-09-10T14-20-10-766Z","verification":{"anchor":"pass","image":"not-applicable","entailment":{"verdict":"yes","quote":"「二つで一組をなすもののうちの片方」を意味する ʔarke","note":null,"model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","prompt_version":"verify-v1.0","date":"2026-09-10"},"human":null},"status":"checked","routing":{"section":null,"model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","prompt_version":"route-v1.0","date":"2026-09-10"}}
{"id":"stmt:kirikae1997@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0011-02","source":"source:kirikae1997","asset":"asset:kirikae1997@gemini-3-flash-preview","locator":{"leaf":11,"printed":11,"section":null,"example":null},"anchor":{"exact":"音節末の r [ɾ] が含まれている。この音は、日本語の r と同じく舌先の急速な上下運動からなる。舌先は歯茎を叩いたあと再び元あった位置近くに戻る。舌全体としては直前の母音に近い構えを回復する。声帯の振動はまだ続いているから、次の音節に移る前に直前の母音に類似した母音が繰り返されることになる。","match":1,"method":"exact","leaf":11},"statement":{"en":"In syllable-final r [ɾ], as the vocal folds continue vibrating after the tongue tip taps the alveolar ridge and the tongue restores a posture close to the preceding vowel, an echo-like vowel similar to the preceding vowel is repeated before moving to the next syllable.","ja":"音節末の r [ɾ] では、舌先が歯茎を叩いて舌全体が直前の母音に近い構えを回復する間も声帯の振動が続くため、次の音節に移る前に直前の母音に類似した母音が繰り返される。"},"type":"other","stance":"asserts","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":["syllable-final /r/"]},"hedge":null,"reported":null,"forms":["r"],"topics":["topic:phon/rhotic-r","topic:phon/syllable-template","topic:phon/rhotic-r--coda-echo"],"extracted_by":"act:extract/kirikae1997/2026-09-10T14-20-10-766Z","verification":{"anchor":"pass","image":"not-applicable","entailment":{"verdict":"yes","quote":"舌先は歯茎を叩いたあと再び元あった位置近くに戻る。舌全体としては直前の母音に近い構えを回復する。声帯の振動はまだ続いているから、次の音節に移る前に直前の母音に類似した母音が繰り返されることになる。","note":null,"model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","prompt_version":"verify-v1.0","date":"2026-09-10"},"human":null},"status":"checked","routing":{"section":"topic:phon/rhotic-r--coda-echo","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","prompt_version":"route-v1.0","date":"2026-09-10"}}
{"id":"stmt:kirikae1997@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0011-03","source":"source:kirikae1997","asset":"asset:kirikae1997@gemini-3-flash-preview","locator":{"leaf":11,"printed":11,"section":null,"example":null},"anchor":{"exact":"金田一は、当初、ʔinkar「見る」を inkara と理解していた。そしてこの動詞が一人称の人称接辞 -an をとると","match":1,"method":"exact","leaf":11},"statement":{"en":"The suffix -an is a first-person personal affix attaching to verbs like ʔinkar 'to see'.","ja":"-an は ʔinkar「見る」のような動詞に付く一人称の人称接辞である。"},"type":"form-function","stance":"asserts","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"hedge":null,"reported":null,"forms":["-an","ʔinkar"],"topics":["topic:person/person-marking-architecture","topic:person/indefinite-fourth-person-paradigm","topic:person/first-person-plural-and-clusivity","topic:person/person-marking-architecture--side-encoding"],"extracted_by":"act:extract/kirikae1997/2026-09-10T14-20-10-766Z","verification":{"anchor":"pass","image":"not-applicable","entailment":{"verdict":"yes","quote":"この動詞が一人称の人称接辞 -an をとると","note":null,"model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","prompt_version":"verify-v1.0","date":"2026-09-10"},"human":null},"status":"checked","routing":{"section":"topic:person/person-marking-architecture--side-encoding","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","prompt_version":"route-v1.0","date":"2026-09-10"}}
{"id":"stmt:kirikae1997@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0011-04","source":"source:kirikae1997","asset":"asset:kirikae1997@gemini-3-flash-preview","locator":{"leaf":11,"printed":11,"section":null,"example":null},"anchor":{"exact":"上の例ではさらに接続助詞の awa が続くので、in|ka|ra|na|wa のような音節の連続体になる。","match":1,"method":"exact","leaf":11},"statement":{"en":"awa functions as a conjunctive particle.","ja":"awa は接続助詞として機能する。"},"type":"membership","stance":"asserts","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"hedge":null,"reported":null,"forms":["awa"],"topics":["topic:discourse/conjunctions-discourse-connectives","topic:complex/conditional-temporal-concessive-clauses","topic:discourse/conjunctions-discourse-connectives--word-class"],"extracted_by":"act:extract/kirikae1997/2026-09-10T14-20-10-766Z","verification":{"anchor":"pass","image":"not-applicable","entailment":{"verdict":"yes","quote":"上の例ではさらに接続助詞の awa が続くので","note":null,"model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","prompt_version":"verify-v1.0","date":"2026-09-10"},"human":null},"status":"checked","routing":{"section":"topic:discourse/conjunctions-discourse-connectives--word-class","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","prompt_version":"route-v1.0","date":"2026-09-10"}}
{"id":"stmt:kirikae1997@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0011-05","source":"source:kirikae1997","asset":"asset:kirikae1997@gemini-3-flash-preview","locator":{"leaf":11,"printed":11,"section":null,"example":null},"anchor":{"exact":"金田一は後に「r 音に終わる音節の存在は故知里幸恵女史が初めて説いたところである。それはバチラー辞書の二版を所持していて、その中の次の類の語をば一一こくめいに終りの母音を抹消していたものだった」と述べて、kor「持つ」、kar「造る」、mokor「眠る」などをその類のものとしてあげている。","match":0.685,"method":"bigram-dice","leaf":11},"statement":{"en":"Ainu possesses syllable-final -r in words such as kor 'to have', kar 'to make', and mokor 'to sleep' (rather than disyllabic forms with an inherent final vowel).","ja":"アイヌ語には kor「持つ」、kar「造る」、mokor「眠る」などの語において、音節末の r で終わる音節が存在する。"},"type":"existence","stance":"reports","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"hedge":null,"reported":{"note":"金田一京助, 1960"},"forms":["kor","kar","mokor"],"topics":["topic:phon/rhotic-r","topic:phon/syllable-template","topic:phon/rhotic-r--coda-echo"],"extracted_by":"act:extract/kirikae1997/2026-09-10T14-20-10-766Z","verification":{"anchor":"fail","image":"not-applicable","entailment":null,"human":null},"status":"extracted","routing":{"section":"topic:phon/rhotic-r--coda-echo","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","prompt_version":"route-v1.0","date":"2026-09-10"}}
{"id":"stmt:kirikae1997@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0003-01","source":"source:kirikae1997","asset":"asset:kirikae1997@gemini-3-flash-preview","locator":{"leaf":3,"printed":null,"section":null,"example":null},"anchor":{"exact":"母音　　　　　　　i　　e　　a　　o　　u","match":1,"method":"exact","leaf":3},"statement":{"en":"Ainu has five vowels: i, e, a, o, and u.","ja":"アイヌ語では母音として i, e, a, o, u の5音が用いられる。"},"type":"existence","stance":"asserts","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"hedge":null,"reported":null,"forms":["i","e","a","o","u"],"topics":["topic:phon/vowel-inventory","topic:phon/vowel-inventory--inventory"],"extracted_by":"act:extract/kirikae1997/2026-09-10T14-20-10-766Z","verification":{"anchor":"pass","image":"not-applicable","entailment":{"verdict":"yes","quote":"母音　　　　　　　i　　e　　a　　o　　u","note":null,"model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","prompt_version":"verify-v1.0","date":"2026-09-10"},"human":null},"status":"checked","routing":{"section":"topic:phon/vowel-inventory--inventory","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","prompt_version":"route-v1.0","date":"2026-09-10"}}
{"id":"stmt:kirikae1997@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0003-02","source":"source:kirikae1997","asset":"asset:kirikae1997@gemini-3-flash-preview","locator":{"leaf":3,"printed":null,"section":null,"example":null},"anchor":{"exact":"子音　　　　　　唇音　口蓋音　軟口蓋音　声門音\n　　　　　　　閉鎖音　 p　　　t　　　　k　　　　ʔ\n　　　　　　　摩擦音　　　　　s　　　　　　　　h\n　　　　　　　破擦音　　　　　c\n　　　　　　　弾き音　　　　　r\n　　　　　　　鼻音　　 m　　　n\n　　　　　　　半母音　　　　　y　　　　w","match":1,"method":"exact","leaf":3},"statement":{"en":"Ainu has twelve consonants: stops p, t, k, ʔ, fricatives s, h, affricate c, tap r, nasals m, n, and semivowels y, w.","ja":"アイヌ語の子音には、閉鎖音 p, t, k, ʔ、摩擦音 s, h、破擦音 c、弾き音 r、鼻音 m, n、半母音 y, w が用いられる。"},"type":"existence","stance":"asserts","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"hedge":null,"reported":null,"forms":["p","t","k","ʔ","s","h","c","r","m","n","y","w"],"topics":["topic:phon/consonant-inventory","topic:phon/consonant-inventory--phonemes"],"extracted_by":"act:extract/kirikae1997/2026-09-10T14-20-10-766Z","verification":{"anchor":"pass","image":"not-applicable","entailment":{"verdict":"yes","quote":"子音　　　　　　唇音　口蓋音　軟口蓋音　声門音\n閉鎖音　 p　　　t　　　　k　　　　ʔ\n摩擦音　　　　　s　　　　　　　　h\n破擦音　　　　　c\n弾き音　　　　　r\n鼻音　　 m　　　n\n半母音　　　　　y　　　　w","note":null,"model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","prompt_version":"verify-v1.0","date":"2026-09-10"},"human":null},"status":"checked","routing":{"section":"topic:phon/consonant-inventory--phonemes","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","prompt_version":"route-v1.0","date":"2026-09-10"}}
